      "id": "code",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "python",
      "source": "last = {}\nleft = best = 0\n\nfor right, ch in enumerate(s):\n    if ch in last and last[ch] >= left:\n        left = last[ch] + 1\n    last[ch] = right\n    best = max(best, right - left + 1)"
    },
